Package: msacanvas
Title: Multiple Sequence Alignment Viewer Widget
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: person("Paulo", "Nuin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4915-664X"))
Description: An 'htmlwidgets' binding of the 'msa-canvas' alignment viewer for
    'Shiny', 'R Markdown' and 'Quarto'. Alignments are sent to the browser as a
    versioned JSON document. The widget loads no file from the network.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/nuin/alignment-kit
BugReports: https://github.com/nuin/alignment-kit/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: htmlwidgets (>= 1.5), jsonlite
Suggests: shiny
